<Prose title="Terms of use" label="Players / Terms" updated="[DATE]" description={`Terms for using ${site.name} games and website.`}>
  <p class="note">Template: review and complete every [bracketed] part before publishing. This is a starting point, not legal advice.</p>
  <p>By playing {site.name} games or using this website you agree to these terms.</p>
  <h2>Using our games</h2>
  <p>We give you a personal, non-transferable license to play our games for fun. Please don't copy, modify, resell or reverse-engineer them, or use cheats that affect other players.</p>
  <h2>Purchases</h2>
  <p>Virtual items bought in our games have no real-world value and can't be exchanged for money. Refunds follow the rules of the App Store or Google Play.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update our games and these terms. We'll post the new date at the top of this page.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> · [Governing law: your country]</p>
</Prose>
